 "reason": "D-1 (independent audit, 2026-09-06): the type ownership marker was kir:{sha1 of the WHOLE grounded program}:{op_id}, so editing a neighbouring wall moved the address of an untouched type and a legitimate republish of the same project refused on ownership. The address now comes from the authored program's stable lineage when the envelope carries one (project_id on the Project path); a bare program keeps the whole-program hash byte for byte, which is why NO frozen key changed for that half. A stable address is not permission to rewrite: create_wall_type reuse gained a named refusal when the existing composition differs from the requested one, and that guard is the entire frozen delta.",
